title: MSI Installation from Desktop, Downloads or ProgramData
status: experimental
description: Detects msiexec.exe installing an MSI package from a user Desktop, Downloads or ProgramData directory. Observed in the EtherRAT intrusion where a malicious MSI masquerading as a Sysinternals tool was run from such a location.
references:
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2026/05/11/flash-alert-etherrat-and-tuktuk-c2-end-in-the-gentleman-ransomware/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/21
tags:
    - attack.execution
    - attack.t1204.002
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
    service: sysmon
detection:
    selection_img:
        - Image|endswith: '\msiexec.exe'
        - OriginalFileName: 'msiexec.exe'
    selection_ext:
        CommandLine|contains: '.msi'
    selection_path:
        CommandLine|contains:
            - '\Desktop\'
            - '\Downloads\'
            - '\ProgramData\'
    condition: all of selection_*
    EventID: 1
fields:
    - ParentImage
    - Image
    - CommandLine
    - User
falsepositives:
    - Administrators or users legitimately installing software downloaded to these folders
level: low
